 <h4>Reading these numbers</h4>
 <p>A larger note count is not a better transcription. Where the two disagree on tempo by a
 factor of two, they are notating the same performance at different note values and every raw
 total across them is incomparable; the page says so on the song where it happens.</p>
 <p>Songsterr's <code>aiGenerated</code> flag and the author name come from its meta API. Ghost and
 grace fields are optional in their format and are counted per tab rather than assumed.</p>
